    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Fully sealed metal containers block flying highway stones, prevent water damage during heavy rainfall, and filter out abrasive dust. They also deter vandalism and theft through locked compartments, making them the preferred choice for luxury and classic cars.</p>
