    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Open Trailers:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Though widely used across car carrier india networks, open racks expose vehicles to wind-driven gravel, UV degradation, and weather fluctuations. They offer minimal security against unauthorized access or accidental scratches during transit.</p>
